Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.10,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:07.62,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1425,5700,6820)\pos(640,385.545)}Episode 13
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:07.62,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.906,564.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,1425,5700,6820)}White Gate Tower - Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fèngxiān?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:35.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294.755,455.455)\fade(255,0,255,0,545,2640,3020)}Lü Bù\NStyled: Fèngxiān
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:40.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(981.151,484.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,3620,3740)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fengxian,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I have led my armies here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}not to take Xú Province, but for\Nyour benefit, General. That is all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.10,0:00:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I heard you, Fengxian, were going to send\Nyour daughter to Yuán Shù for a marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.42,0:00:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but that Yuan Shu declared himself Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.86,0:00:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}That is treason most heinous!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.62,0:01:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}And you, sir, helped against\N Dǒng Zhuō, earning glory!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.86,0:01:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Why would you forsake your honor\Nto bend yourself to a traitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If Xiàpī falls, your regrets will be too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Better to surrender and\Nhelp us support the House of Hàn!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You won't lose your Marquis rank!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Fengxian, consider this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.82,0:01:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.70,0:01:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdraw first, then we may talk. How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Rotten traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.94,0:01:39.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(951.13,477.273)\fade(255,0,255,0,0,9000,9000)}Chén Gōng \NStyled: Gōngtái
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are!?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.38,0:01:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you are!\NA wolf in sheep's clothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.90,0:01:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,See my arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.14,0:01:52.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(888.358,441.818)\fade(255,0,255,0,500,9000,9000)}Xiàpī
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gōngtái! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chén Gōng, I swear I will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongtai, why do you despise Cáo Cāo that much?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Cao Cao came from afar and\Nhe cannot maintain this course for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.38,0:02:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}General, you can lead \Nthe garrison outside the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Me and the remainder will guard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If Cao Cao were to attack you,\NI will lead an army to attack their rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If he attacks the city, General,\Nyou can strike their rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Both ways will get them in between ox horns, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}In ten days, his army will run out of\Nprovisions and would naturally fall back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}That way, you can again be on the offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In one beat, you can rout the Cao army!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.90,0:03:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,According to your words, Gongtai...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold. Order men to bring more cotton clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:36.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(955.224,469.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,500,1750,2180)}Xiàpī
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! In formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.54,0:04:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Chen Gong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.66,0:04:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Husband, how could you abandon us and your own men?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.34,0:04:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If something unexpected happens, would I then still be your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.78,0:04:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Form up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, please give an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Form up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you've hesitated for three days already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.26,0:04:43.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Though we are besieged, they haven't broken through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If we hesitate, thus trapping us,\Nit will be too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.98,0:04:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.74,0:04:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you can't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:58.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(998.891,470.455)\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2980,3420)}Lady Yán
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:05:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Can Gāo Shùn and Chen Gong really defend Xiàpī?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.58,0:05:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a flaw, it will be too late for regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.46,0:05:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only going out to cut off Cao Cao's supply lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was at Cháng'ān, you abandoned me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.26,0:05:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It was fortunate we could later meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.02,0:05:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But today, you want to abandon me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, hurry! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than leave the city, it would\Nbe more feasible to defend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I have another plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Cao's army has limited supplies,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:06:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so he's sent men to Xǔdū for more.\NSoon or later, they will arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.82,0:06:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you ought to lead your most elite to cut off their lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.70,0:06:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a brilliant plan. I beseech you,\NGeneral, to make a decision now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.98,0:06:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao has many tricks and has always been good at breaking supply lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he not defend his own supply lines?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot act rashly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:07:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We will die without a place to be buried at!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,General, why not go out and ask Yuan Shu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.22,0:07:13.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(975.693,452.727)\fade(255,0,255,0,376,1940,2340)}Xǔ Sì
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.22,0:07:13.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(424.392,452.727)\fade(255,0,255,0,376,1940,2340)}Wáng Kǎi
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.98,0:07:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuan Shu is in Huáinán; if you manage to get to him, propose a marriage alliance-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.82,0:07:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct! Yuan Shu can send troops to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your families should unite for a pincer attack. \NCao's army will be easy to rout!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.18,0:07:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.98,0:07:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.10,0:07:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Xǔ Sì? Wáng Kǎi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.78,0:08:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.94,0:08:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Has anyone else been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two left the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been several days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there no news from them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.02,0:08:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Since yesterday, Xu Si and Wang Kai have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You've recently been of an inconstant mind\Nand have sighed often.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You drink to remove the fears,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:09:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and there is not a word nor reply from you whenever I speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you are so depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As your wife, it's too painful to look on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that I won't talk... it's really...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,it's really that my subordinates won't let me tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.58,0:09:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A few days ago, Xu Si and Wang Kai\Ncame in and said to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.78,0:09:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"Now Yuan Shu resides in Huáinán, his power booming."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,"Since we had entered talks of a\Nmarriage alliance previously,"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.98,0:09:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"and considering our situation now,\Nwhy not ask again?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,"This time, Yuan Shu will send reinforcements\Nour way so that we may do a pincer attack."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.02,0:09:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,"Then Cao Cao will not be difficult to rout!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:10:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus I agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you listen to others, yet never tell me anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,General! Xu Si and Wang Kai have returned\Nfrom Shòuchūn and are already here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,General?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.50,0:10:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,General?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Below his city, we met Yuan Shu\Nand presented the letter from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Because you, sire, had Yuan Shu's envoys killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he declined our proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.78,0:10:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now that we have came to ask of it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he has blamed you, sire, for your chronic treachery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.94,0:10:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}He added that if it weren't for the Cao's army besiegement, and the crisis of Xiàpī,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.22,0:10:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}how could you marry your daughter off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.38,0:10:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This time, only when you first send your daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.02,0:10:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}will he be willing to relieve us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.78,0:11:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}But how can I send her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Our enemies have besieged the city on all sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When we went,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}had it not been for Zhāng Liáo and Gao Shun, we wouldn't have broken through Liu Bei's camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Otherwise, we would've been\Nghosts before Shòuchūn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}During return, \NGeneral Hǎo Méng broke from the rear,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}but was captured by\NZhāng Fēi and given to Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}They know our situation,\Nhence we ought to be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}As your lowly servant sees it, unless... unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Unless you will escort your daughter personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}who else can break out of the siege?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How could you think of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I will escort her today, how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.34,0:11:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Today has the aura of devils, \Nwe cannot leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Tomorrow is auspicious,\Nand you should leave at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, it's tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:38.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(981.151,373.636)\fade(255,0,255,0,480,2440,2960)}Lü Bù's\Ndaughter
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor's orders. If anyone lets\NLü Bu escape, they shall be killed on the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry! Don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:13:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this happen to {\i1}me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The Adminstrator of Hénèi;\NZhāng Yáng sent troops east
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.14,0:14:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}to reinforce Lü Bu, but his subordinate, Yáng Chǒu, killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Zhang Yang may be gone, but there is\NYuán Shào in the north to be concerned of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In the east is Liú Biǎo and Zhāng Xiù, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Xiàpī has resisted for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}We should abandon siege,\Nreturn to the capital, and negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.74,0:14:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Gentlemen, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Chancellor, you should not do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Lü Bu suffered repeated defeats\Nand his morale has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}An army's will depends on their leader.\NWhen their will has fallen, the army's spirit falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}As of now, Lü Bu has not recovered;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:14:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Chén Gōng cannot decide on a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.54,0:15:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sir, if you exploit this to intensify\Nyour attack on Xiàpī, Lü Bu will be captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.30,0:15:08.62,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I have a single plan to break through Xiàpī,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:11.42,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}able to take on over 200,000 soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Perhaps you mean using the Yí and Sì rivers to inundate Xiàpī?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:19.26,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}That is my intention.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.26,0:15:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Flood it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.22,0:15:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Report! General, Cao Cao flooded the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.58,0:15:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Report! General! The southern and northern\Ngates have been flooded!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.38,0:15:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General, the eastern gate of Xiàpī is intact!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.14,0:15:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,All the others are flooded!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.78,0:16:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have Red Hare, who can cross waters\Nas if they were fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.54,0:16:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I have to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.14,0:17:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:49.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Look at me, so disheveled and haggard, all because of wine...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.02,0:18:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting today...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.02,0:18:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No more wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Men! Pass my orders. Starting today,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.14,0:18:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone who drinks will meet execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry! Secure the area!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.30,0:18:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to keep this place secure! Hurry, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.26,0:18:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongtai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongtai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.10,0:19:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass my orders! Starting today,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.22,0:19:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone who drinks will be beheaded!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:30.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(985.245,394.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,1120,1500)}Hóu Chéng
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.62,0:19:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you go help reinforce the walls, instead of coming here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.22,0:19:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General, our fifteen stolen horses have been recovered!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.22,0:19:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It is only for your might that I was able to recover them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.82,0:20:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The generals have come to congratulate me with wine. I wouldn't dare keep it for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My might?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I had just banned alcohol, but you gather your cohorts to drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you are working against me with Cao Cao?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.26,0:20:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A ban on alcohol?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.06,0:20:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.82,0:20:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Execute him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.98,0:20:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,General, lower the knife for a good man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:36.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(302.942,394.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,9999,9999)}Sòng Xiàn
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:36.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(798.294,394.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,9999,9999)}Wèi Xù
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For your sake, I will only give him a hundred beatings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.26,0:20:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General, we are facing a strong foe!\NWe need everyone we have!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.30,0:20:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.54,0:21:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So you two do know that we are facing a terrible foe, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.90,0:21:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I will take off fifty beatings!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be beaten fifty times\Nso that you two stop crowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.62,0:21:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sòng Xiàn, I owe my very life to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.18,0:22:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lü Bu only cares about his women and treats us like weeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.62,0:22:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Cáo's army has besieged us with water, we are close to being dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.86,0:22:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lü Bu is not benevolent nor just.\NHow about we desert and go elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.70,0:22:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Desert? That would be the act of a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.18,0:22:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to capture Lü Bu and\Nsurrender to Lord Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.26,0:22:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture Lü Bu and take him to Lord Cao?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.70,0:22:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lü Bu relies on his mount, Red Hare!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.18,0:22:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You two can surrender the city\Nafter capturing that traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.70,0:22:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be the one stealing the horse for Lord Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.86,0:22:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You take the horse. Wèi Xù and I will pretend to chase you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.90,0:25:23.46,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,Today we capture Xiàpī! Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.94,0:26:05.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao, from dawn, assaulted the city until noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.62,0:26:08.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Lü Bu's army suffered countless casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.70,0:26:14.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao's army withdrew temporarily \Nand Lü Bu stationed himself on the city tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.66,0:27:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you... what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.58,0:27:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.46,0:27:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We have captured Lü Bu!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.98,0:28:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.34,0:28:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.86,0:28:17.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(951.13,375)}White Gate \NTower
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.58,0:29:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.58,0:29:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.78,0:29:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.30,0:30:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.78,0:30:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.46,0:30:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.26,0:30:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How can one bind a tiger loosely?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.10,0:30:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I never belittled you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.10,0:30:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why rebel against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.26,0:30:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You only heed your wife's words,\N and never your officers. What do {\i1}you{\i0} think?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.68,0:30:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You punish your subordinates at will,\Nand you ask why rebel?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.58,0:30:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lü Bu,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.50,0:31:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,now that you're here.\NWhat can you say for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.70,0:31:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you seem to have become thinner recently...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.58,0:31:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fengxian, had I not bound you,\Nthen how could I rest assured?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.50,0:31:36.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,380,2460,3020)\pos(971.599,496.485)}Gāo Shùn
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.10,0:31:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any words?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.82,0:31:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang him, then behead him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.38,0:31:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.34,0:31:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongtai, have you been well since we last met?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.02,0:32:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When you left my service,\Ndid you ever expect this to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.42,0:32:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left your service because of your crooked ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.02,0:32:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My "crooked ways"?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.94,0:32:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you explain why you served Lü Bu alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.18,0:32:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Lü Bu, despite his lack of wisdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.42,0:32:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,does not resemble you in such deceit and treachery.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.18,0:32:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You claim to be full of wisdom and wit,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.70,0:32:45.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but just how did you fall into such a predicament?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.94,0:32:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All I regret is that the man didn't heed my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.62,0:32:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Had he listened, we would not have become captives.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.66,0:32:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongtai, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.50,0:33:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So then,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.54,0:33:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongtai, what do you think ought to happen today?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.58,0:33:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, there is death for me, and that is all!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.78,0:33:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, naturally you would prefer death,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.10,0:33:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but what will happen to your mother, wife, and children?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.94,0:33:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I heard that those who rule with regard to filial piety do not harm one's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.22,0:33:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}One who practices benevolence\Ncannot cut off the sacrifices at one's tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.82,0:33:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now my family is in your hands. That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.18,0:33:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongtai!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.02,0:34:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Now that I'm captured, go ahead. I will die without regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.90,0:34:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongtai?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.34,0:34:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongtai!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.38,0:34:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongtai?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.38,0:34:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongtai!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.22,0:34:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I abandoned my magistrate post\Nto follow you, sir, to achieve great deeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.30,0:34:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"Rather I betray the world,\Nthan let the world betray me."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.14,0:35:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Escort Gongtai's family to Xǔdū so that they may be looked after.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.18,0:35:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who delays will meet with death.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.30,0:35:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sir, you are the guest;\N I am a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.90,0:36:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Why not save us both?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.38,0:36:05.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(338.422,467.727)\fade(255,0,255,0,450,2940,3300)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.10,0:36:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.34,0:36:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord, you only worry about me, that is all,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.94,0:36:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but now, I am willing to serve you, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.26,0:36:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sire, you take the lead; I will assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.22,0:36:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Why worry about the unruly world then?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.02,0:36:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Lord Xuándé, how do you feel about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.38,0:36:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sire, do you remember the fates of\NDīng Yuán and Dǒng Zhuō?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.42,0:36:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.22,0:37:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sire, do you remember {\i1}the fates of\NDīng Yuán and Dǒng Zhuō?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.06,0:37:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.70,0:37:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.90,0:37:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.90,0:37:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then cut his head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.66,0:37:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei! You traitorous bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.30,0:37:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no one with less principle than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.26,0:37:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei! Did you forget how I saved you when\Nshooting that arrow through my halberd?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.82,0:37:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,An arrow through my halberd-
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.78,0:37:39.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(957.953,445.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,450,1660,2100)}Zhāng Liáo\NStyled: Wényuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.22,0:37:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Lü Bu!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.30,0:37:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You coward! It is only but death! Why be afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.98,0:37:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This man looks familiar...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.02,0:38:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We met each other at Púyáng City.\NHow could you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.50,0:38:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So you remember as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.74,0:38:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.22,0:38:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.74,0:38:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a pity that the fire that day\N wasn't big enough to roast you to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.98,0:38:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.06,0:38:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, don't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.10,0:38:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a man of honor and loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.06,0:38:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, let him live to do justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.30,0:38:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have long known Wényuǎn for his virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.66,0:38:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I will plead for him with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.02,0:38:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How couldn't I have heard of Wenyuan's good name?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.58,0:38:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I was merely jesting, that is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.58,0:39:09.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the 3rd year of the Jiàn'ān era,\Nthe winter of 198 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.42,0:39:15.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao finally fulfilled his wish\N by wiping out the trouble within his heart, Lü Bu,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.06,0:39:18.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and receiving Zhang Liao's surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.22,0:39:23.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The General of Chariots and Cavalry,\NChē Zhòu, controlled Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.90,0:39:29.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Since then, Cao Cao's power grew stronger, as did his prestige.

